## Test Infrastructure Issues

### 1. WASM Module Coverage
- Current WASM module provides comprehensive test functions
- But C++ tests don't exercise all available functions
- Function lookup failures result in GTEST_SKIP() instead of proper error handling

### 2. Error Path Testing
- No tests simulate LLVM API failures
- No tests simulate memory allocation failures
- No tests validate error recovery behavior

### 3. Platform Coverage
- Only x86 optimization path tested
- Common implementation path completely untested
- No cross-platform validation

